{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-21040","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21040-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21040-0","text":"智识命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21040-item-ItemConfigEquipment-21040-1","text":"「芝士流心！你负责迷晕星球的守卫！」\n「豆沙灰灰！你负责攻陷星球的士兵！」\n「盐渍冬梅！你负责拿下星球的首脑！」\n「大王，您要去做什么！」\n「我负责扮演可爱猫猫迷惑这些蠢笨的人类！」\n\n那一天，银河众文明终于回想起了，被它们支配的恐惧……","speaker":""}]}
